@startuml
title MVP Rube Goldberg Chain

actor Timer as TIM
participant Gear as GEA
participant Rope as ROP
participant Gate as GAT
participant Ball as BAL
participant Laser as LAS
participant Fan as FAN
participant Balloon as BLN
participant Thorns as THN

== Phase 1: Countdown (Ticks 0–119) ==
TIM -> TIM: state_counter += 1 each tick

== Phase 2: Timer Fires (Tick 119) ==
TIM -> GEA: state_counter >= 120\nGear activates
note over GEA: angular_velocity = 8\nstate_counter cycles 0–7

== Phase 3: Gate Lifting (Ticks 119–306) ==
GEA -> ROP: connected_1 = 3 (Gate)
ROP -> ROP: rope pull physics\nconstraint enforcement
ROP -> GAT: gp.y += 4 each tick
GAT -> GAT: Gate rises, holding ball

== Phase 4: Ball Released (Tick 307) ==
GAT -> BAL: gate.y > ball.y + 10\nBall released
BAL -> BAL: is_moving = true\nFalling via gravity
BAL -> LAS: AABB collision overlap

== Phase 5: Laser Triggered (Tick 307) ==
LAS -> LAS: state_counter = 2\nis_powered = true
LAS -> FAN: Fan powered ON
LAS -> BLN: Balloon released\nis_moving = true

== Phase 6: Balloon Escapes (Tick 307) ==
FAN -> BLN: vel_x += 30 per tick\n(pushes balloon right)
BLN -> BLN: gravity_buoyancy = -2000\n(floats upward)
BLN -> THN: y < 80 (balloon reached thorns)

== Phase 7: Win ==
note over BLN, THN: === WIN ===\nBalloon popped by thorns

@enduml
